    {
      "category": "Armed conflicts and attacks",
      "text": "Iranian lawmaker Hassan Ghashghavi says that efforts to restore the Islamabad Memorandum deal between Iran and the United States are underway. ((AFP via Arab News))"
    },
    {
      "category": "Armed conflicts and attacks",
      "text": "Iranian foreign minister Abbas Araghchi says that Iran and Oman are nearing a deal to manage the Strait of Hormuz after the U.S. halted its recent strikes against the country. ((Al Jazeera))"
    },
    {
      "category": "Armed conflicts and attacks",
      "text": "The Israel Defense Forces (IDF) confirms that they have killed three militants in separate strikes last week, including a Jaish al-Islam militant in Gaza City, a Hamas commander in the Jabalya Battalion, and a Palestinian Islamic Jihad militant. ((The Jerusalem Post))"
    },
    {
      "category": "Armed conflicts and attacks",
      "text": "The IDF's 401st Brigade says that they have destroyed 1,200 Hezbollah tunnels and concluded their mission in southern Lebanon, ending their eight-month deployment. ((Israel National News)) ((The Jerusalem Post))"
    },
