      "text": "A drone strike hits a customary court in Kabkabiya District, North Darfur, Sudan, killing at least 37 people. ((Al Jazeera))"
    },
    {
      "category": "Armed conflicts and attacks",
      "text": "Police say a suspected suicide bombing outside a police station in Kabal, Khyber Pakhtunkhwa, Pakistan, killed at least 17 people, including seven officers and the suspected bomber, and injured at least 34 others. ((Reuters))"
    },
    {
